All six features are implemented and verified. Here's a summary of the changes:

**`app/auth.py`** — `require_api_key` now validates the `X-API-Key` header against `VALID_API_KEYS`, raises HTTP 401 on missing/invalid keys, and returns the username on success.

**`app/main.py`** — five changes:

| Feature | Detail |
|---|---|
| `GET /tasks` filtering | Added `status`, `priority`, `assigned_to` optional query params; all combinable, applied sequentially |
| `GET /tasks` pagination | Added `page` (default 1) and `page_size` (default 20) with `ge=1` validation; slicing applied after filtering |
| `POST /tasks` | Auth-guarded (`Depends(require_api_key)`), validates `project_id` exists (404 if not), auto-increments ID, returns 201 |
| `PUT /tasks/{task_id}` | Auth-guarded, partial update via `exclude_unset=True`, returns updated task, 404 on missing |
| `DELETE /tasks/{task_id}` | Auth-guarded, removes from list, returns 204, 404 on missing |
